    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Remember ye not the former things, neither consider the things of old.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I will do a new thing; now it shall spring forth; shall ye not know it? I will even make a way in the wilderness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.43.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.43.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rivers in the desert.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The beast of the field shall honour me, the dragons and the owls: because I give waters in the wilderness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.43.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rivers in the desert, to give drink to my people, my chosen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This people have I formed for myself; they shall shew forth my praise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ But thou hast not called upon me, O Jacob; but thou hast been weary of me, O Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast not brought me the small cattle of thy burnt offerings; neither hast thou honoured me with thy sacrifices. I have not caused thee to serve with an offering, nor wearied thee with incense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast bought me no sweet cane with money, neither hast thou filled me with the fat of thy sacrifices: but thou hast made me to serve with thy sins, thou hast wearied me with thine iniquities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.43.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.43.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that blotteth out thy transgressions for mine own sake, and will not remember thy sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put me in remembrance: let us plead together: declare thou, that thou mayest be justified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy first father hath sinned, and thy teachers have transgressed against me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I have profaned the princes of the sanctuary, and have given Jacob to the curse, and Israel to reproaches.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
